      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59ff4b10eddb5c098c28fa5a|full_name}: Emissive objects do not have to be unlit. The Unity Standard shader is both lit and emissive, the emission value is simply added to the result of the lighting calculation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
